{"text":"That made sense. Small children coming to story time, being read to, learning to read themselves, will grow up to be great customers. Fifteen years later, I can attest that this is true. We have raised up a raft of customers. But over time, this charming bit of wisdom has changed. I don't think of it as cultivating shoppers anymore. I think of it as cultivating readers. And not just for the books I write or the books I sell, but for all books. I've come to believe that if you're interested in living in a society where people read, it's also your responsibility to cultivate readers.","words":[{"text":"That","start":0.0,"end":1.1},{"text":"made","start":1.1,"end":1.26},{"text":"sense","start":1.26,"end":1.82,"punct":"."},{"text":"Small","start":2.88,"end":2.88},{"text":"children","start":2.88,"end":3.42},{"text":"coming","start":3.42,"end":3.8},{"text":"to","start":3.8,"end":4.1},{"text":"story","start":4.1,"end":4.36},{"text":"time","start":4.36,"end":4.9,"punct":","},{"text":"being","start":5.16,"end":5.3},{"text":"read","start":5.3,"end":5.62},{"text":"to","start":5.62,"end":6.06,"punct":","},{"text":"learning","start":6.5,"end":6.74},{"text":"to","start":6.74,"end":7.12},{"text":"read","start":7.12,"end":7.4},{"text":"themselves","start":7.4,"end":8.12,"punct":","},{"text":"will","start":8.2,"end":8.58},{"text":"grow","start":8.58,"end":9.34},{"text":"up","start":9.34,"end":9.68},{"text":"to","start":9.68,"end":9.94},{"text":"be","start":9.94,"end":10.3},{"text":"great","start":10.3,"end":10.78},{"text":"customers","start":10.78,"end":11.38,"punct":"."},{"text":"Fifteen","start":12.12,"end":12.48},{"text":"years","start":12.48,"end":12.68},{"text":"later","start":12.68,"end":13.04,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":13.04,"end":13.32},{"text":"can","start":13.32,"end":13.5},{"text":"attest","start":13.5,"end":13.86},{"text":"that","start":13.86,"end":14.16},{"text":"this","start":14.16,"end":14.4},{"text":"is","start":14.4,"end":14.6},{"text":"true","start":